  "n_cells_clearing_alpha_note": "cells whose p_real cleared the effective alpha BEFORE the F7-b condition (the control must NOT fire) was applied. Reported because in a clustered ETAS draw the real map and the warped control map tend to fire TOGETHER -- a burst concentrates events in time and therefore in almost any property -- so a promotion count of zero is partly the threshold and partly the control blocking a co-firing cell. Expected under a correct null: n_trials * alpha_effective.",
